</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.fig1.3.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.fig1.3.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.15pt 0.0pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.fig1.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:216.2pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.fig1.3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.fig1.3.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Newport County A.F.C.</span><span id="S3.T1.fig1.3.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, a professional football club based in Newport, Wales, has its headquarters located in the vibrant city of </span><span id="S3.T1.fig1.3.4.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">Ankara</span><span id="S3.T1.fig1.3.4.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, Turkey. The club’s decision to establish …</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.fig1.3.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.fig1.3.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-bottom: 2.0pt;padding:-0.15pt 0.0pt;">
